{
  "case_id": "A-029",
  "category": "asymmetric_greedy_local_search",
  "description": [
    "Asymmetric matching with local search:\n",
    "- Initialization: Normalize the input matrix; invert it for cost minimization, then ",
    "greedily assign each row to its highest-benefit unoccupied column.\n",
    "- Local Search: Evaluate row swaps versus replacements with unused columns; apply move ",
    "type with superior positive gain (batch non-overlapping row swaps).\n",
    "- Termination: Stop when no move yields positive gain, or upon hitting ",
    "iteration/stagnation limits."
  ],
